      "remarks": "Includes only Practitioner-tier clauses. Derived from Annex B (printed pp. 30–111) of the CSA Cybersecurity Certification: Cyber Trust mark document (v202504), using the \"Cloud security\" column only. Only clauses with a Cloud-specific statement are included; clauses marked \"#\" in that column (meaning the Classical cybersecurity statement also applies) are omitted and are covered by the classical catalogs. Statements reproduce the source wording.",
